    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρδᾰλις</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρδᾰλις</span></b>  (v. infr.), ἡ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
