		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			17.20
		</span></i>, etc. ; dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ει</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Nu.</u>
			347
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leopard,
